Enrichment analysis was performed in Perseus (1.6.7.0) against the set of identified proteins in the corresponding tissue and the results were filtered for an intersection size >10 and the top five enriched terms of each tissue are displayed (SourceDataForFigure7). Skeletal muscle (SKM), brown adipose tissue (BAT).
